        <note type="exegesis">a primitive root;</note>
        <note type="explanation">(absolutely) <hi>to create</hi>; (qualified) <hi>to cut down</hi> (a wood), <hi>select</hi>, <hi>feed</hi> (as formative processes)</note>
        <note type="translation">choose, create (creator), cut down, dispatch, do, make (fat).</note>
      </div>
      <div type="entry" n="2580">
        <w gloss="694a" lemma="חֵן" morph="n-m" POS="khane" xlit="chên" ID="H2580" xml:lang="heb">חן</w>
